{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_1","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"一、五年，春王正月，舍中軍。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_2","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"舍中軍者何？復古也。然則曷為不言三卿？五亦有中，三亦有中。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_3","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"二、楚殺其大夫屈申。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_4","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"三、公如晉。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_5","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"四、夏，莒牟夷以牟婁及防茲來奔。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_6","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"莒牟夷者何？莒大夫也。莒無大夫，此何以書？重地也。其言及防茲來奔何？不以私邑累公邑也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_7","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"五、秋七月，公至自晉。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_8","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"六、戊辰，叔弓帥師敗莒師於濆泉。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_9","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"濆泉者何？直泉也。直泉者何？涌泉也。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_10","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"七、秦伯卒。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_11","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"何以不名？秦者夷也，匿嫡之名也。其名何？嫡得之也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_cdt_185_12","chapterId":"ch_work_cdt_185","textTraditional":"八、冬，楚子、蔡侯、陳侯、許男、頓子、沈子、徐人、越人伐吳。","sentenceOrder":12}],"overrides":{}}